%% alt: A change to a prompt, model, retrieval, tool or configuration runs the fast eval suite in CI, then the full, safety and permission suites. A release gate compares the candidate with production on thresholds and paired comparison: failures produce a report of failing cases, diffs and traces; passes go to a 1 to 5 percent canary with online scoring and then to production. In production, a 1 percent sample goes to judges and human review, and failures become new cases in the versioned eval sets that the suites run on.
flowchart TB
  CH[Change<br/>prompt, model, retrieval,<br/>tool, config]:::human --> CI[CI: fast suite]:::control
  CI -->|pass| FS[Full, safety and<br/>permission suites]:::control
  FS --> G{Release gate<br/>thresholds + paired<br/>comparison}:::control
  G -->|fail| RP[Report<br/>failing cases, diffs]:::tool
  G -->|pass| CA[Canary 1–5%<br/>online scoring]:::model
  CA -->|healthy| PR[Production]:::model
  PR --> SM[Sample 1% → judges<br/>+ human review]:::human
  SM --> DS[(Versioned eval sets<br/>failures become cases)]:::data
  DS -.-> CI
  DS -.-> FS
